          "type": "qa",
          "q": "Q44. How do you reduce the latency of a slow API endpoint?",
          "a_bullets": [
            "==Measure first== with tracing, then fix the biggest slice: usually the database or a downstream call.",
            "Add indexes and kill N+1 queries before anything else.",
            "Cache hot reads; send smaller payloads (fields, pagination, gzip).",
            "Run independent calls in parallel; push slow work to a queue."
          ],
          "example_code": [
            "# 3 calls x 100ms = 300ms",
            "a = await get_user()",
            "# in parallel: ~100ms total",
            "a, b, c = await gather(u(), o(), p())"
          ]
        },
